      <Capitolo>Procedure</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;B&gt; Filter dimensions: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; L = 254 mm. &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; H = 235 mm. &lt;BR&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; S= 32 mm. &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;B&gt; Estimated replacement time: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; 5 minutes &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;B&gt; Location: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; Inside the passenger compartment &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Behind the glove compartment &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;B&gt; Replacement: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Open the glove compartment. &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Inside the compartment, at the top right and left, there are two plastic buttons. Press them to release the compartment so that it can be opened fully. &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Remove the cabin filter cover. &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Pull out the filter. &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;B&gt; Refitting: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; &lt;LI&gt; Follow the procedure in reverse. &lt;BR&gt; &lt;BR&gt; </Corpo>
